WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:01.827
I am both a prince.

00:02.800 --> 00:04.160
And a subject.

00:05.160 --> 00:07.360
How could there be reason to disobey orders?

00:08.560 --> 00:10.360
This is my military seal.

00:11.320 --> 00:16.800
I give it to General Chen I hope General Chen will fulfill his duties diligently.

00:16.880 --> 00:18.880
Do not disappoint the soldiers.

00:26.160 --> 00:30.640
Please rest assured, Your Highness I will not disappoint Your Highness.

00:58.200 --> 01:01.933
He's so obedient just handed over military command like that.

01:04.800 --> 01:09.560
In my heart I'm uneasy A dog that bites.

01:09.640 --> 01:11.040
Never barks.

01:12.120 --> 01:17.240
In the past when Prince of Jin was imprisoned I advised Your Highness to go all the way.

01:17.640 --> 01:22.320
But Your Highness then hesitated Chancellor Chen.

01:22.640 --> 01:24.480
Don't tease me.

01:27.160 --> 01:28.560
Give the order.

01:34.160 --> 01:39.320
Immediately order Qingzhou Army to break camp move toward the capital also.

01:39.400 --> 01:41.800
Send Chen Ying another letter.

01:42.160 --> 01:43.560
Yes.

01:56.880 --> 02:00.000
This is just my personal letter why was it opened?

02:00.080 --> 02:01.280
General Chen Ying ordered.

02:01.360 --> 02:07.040
All correspondence in the army must first be sent to him for review Chen Ying think clearly.

02:07.160 --> 02:08.560
Whose orders do you follow?

02:08.640 --> 02:12.880
I only follow military orders who promoted you all this way?

02:14.160 --> 02:17.520
I really misjudged you get out.

02:46.200 --> 02:51.880
Your Highness let's have a good drink tonight sir the volunteer army families.

02:51.960 --> 02:56.400
All depend on Yiyang's compensation to survive really can't delay any longer want to talk? Fine.

02:56.680 --> 02:58.080
After you're cleaned up.

03:20.080 --> 03:25.320
The heir the princess consort are both in the capital I must consider them.

03:25.640 --> 03:29.000
Right now, no matter what cannot act rashly.

03:30.640 --> 03:32.040
Who?

03:32.960 --> 03:34.960
Your Highness it's me.

03:37.600 --> 03:40.280
Zhu Yuanzhi what are you doing?

03:41.960 --> 03:43.360
At this time.

03:44.080 --> 03:47.627
You kill Chen Ying's men isn't that making things worse?

03:49.440 --> 03:52.840
Your Highness look who's here.

04:01.920 --> 04:04.840
Your Highness this old minister finally sees you.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.400
Please rise quickly.

04:10.160 --> 04:13.120
Huiji is a thousand li from Yiyang how did you come?

04:13.200 --> 04:18.080
Since Your Highness's victory the situation has been crystal clear so I.

04:18.200 --> 04:23.880
Left Huiji Commandery early secretly returned to the capital to plan Your Highness.

04:23.960 --> 04:29.000
This is what I intercepted from the capital A secret letter from Chen Dao to Chen Ying.

04:43.120 --> 04:47.040
This is critical quickly summon Xie Xuan and Uncle Qiu together.

04:53.120 --> 04:57.240
Zhu Yuanzhi, how dare you my sister and the heir are still in the capital.

04:57.320 --> 04:59.320
Are you trying to harm them?

05:01.640 --> 05:03.960
Brother-in-law don't be impulsive.

05:06.080 --> 05:08.760
Father say something.

05:21.000 --> 05:25.600
Your Highness though somewhat offensive I must speak some words.

05:26.400 --> 05:30.960
If Your Highness hesitates further then we'll be like fish on a chopping block at others' mercy.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.560
Enough, Zhu Yuanzhi.

05:33.320 --> 05:35.320
Do you know what you're saying?

05:39.560 --> 05:41.227
I know Your Highness's concerns.

05:41.960 --> 05:46.400
But if Your Highness truly dies here then the princess consort and the heir.

05:46.480 --> 05:48.360
Can they have a good outcome?

05:58.920 --> 06:02.080
Your Highness strike first to gain advantage.

